lthy in production.\n3. **Opened the incident:** **INC-0001**, SEV2, is open for payments-api and the on-call engineer has been paged. The summary describes the bad v5.1.0 deploy and the rollback, and lists confirming recovery and finding the cause in v5.1.0 as follow-ups.\n\nv5.1.0 shouldn't be redeployed until the cause of the errors is found and fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}